msgid "Set speed of the scrolling road animation shown behind the main menu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30040"
msgid "Video"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30041"
msgid "Configure frame rate, widescreen and resolution settings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30042"
msgid "Set internal frame rate. In 'Original' mode, game logic, road scrolling and sprite zooming update at 30fps, but the horizon scrolls at 60fps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30043"
msgid "Extend the play area to a widescreen aspect. Base internal resolution is set to 398x224, increasing the screen width by 25%."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30044"
msgid "Double the game's internal resolution from the original 320x224 to 640x448 (768x448 in widescreen mode). Increases the fidelity of rendered sprites and the road."
msgstr ""

